TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çok güzel, değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Evet, {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}ımı
seviyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ama gerçekten istiyorsan {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:000A:0000}}
Bell{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}e ondan ayrılabilirim.{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet, istiyorum!
Yok, sağ ol.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tut mir leid, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}aber ich häng ganz
schön an diesem Insekt. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Du wirst dir
wohl selbst eins fangen müssen.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sorry, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}but I love that fish too much.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I guess you'll have to catch one of
those yourself!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me costó mucho pescar este pez.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Si quieres uno tendrás que
pescarlo por ti mism{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kusura bakma, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ama o balığı satamayacak
